                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I liked that it is a break from so many shooter games.  However, I am on the fence really about recommending the game.  For a game about being in low or no gravity environments, why does the game not obey Newton's first law?  I can forgive if the game takes some small liberties for the sake of game progression--one does not expect perfect real-world modeling--but this is too distracting.  Your speed should not decrease out in the vacuum of space.",
